        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "1) check validation on creation:  using admin gui (web) add a RELS-EXT datastream relationship with the following date/time value: 2009-10-05T16:02:26+0100",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "NB test object pid in this case was changeme:1",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "RELS-EXT:",
          "type": "text"
