     "body": "<p>Test Notes:</p>\n\n<p>1) check validation on creation:  using admin gui (web) add a RELS-EXT datastream relationship with the following date/time value: 2009-10-05T16:02:26+0100</p>\n\n<p>NB test object pid in this case was changeme:1</p>\n\n<p>RELS-EXT:</p>\n\n<p>&lt;rdf:RDF xmlns:fedora-model=\"info:fedora/fedora-system:def/model#\" xmlns:ns=\"http://www.example.org/dummy#\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;rdf:Description rdf:about=\"info:fedora/changeme:1\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;ns:test rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime\"&gt;2009-10-05T16:02:26+0100&lt;/ns:test&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;/rdf:Description&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/rdf:RDF&gt;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>check validation error reported</li>\n\t<li>modify to 2009-10-05T16:02:26 - save and check no validation eror</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>2) check validation on updates:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>edit above datastream and</li>\n\t<li>modify back to 2009-10-05T16:02:26+0100</li>\n\t<li>verify validation error reported</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>3) Confirm for RELS-INT also (modify subject to </p>\n{pid}\n<p>/DC) - repeat above, starting from RELS-INT as:</p>\n\n<p>&lt;rdf:RDF xmlns:fedora-model=\"info:fedora/fedora-system:def/model#\" xmlns:ns=\"http://www.example.org/dummy#\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;rdf:Description rdf:about=\"info:fedora/changeme:1/DC\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;ns:test rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime\"&gt;2009-10-05T16:02:26+0100&lt;/ns:test&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;/rdf:Description&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/rdf:RDF&gt;</p>",
     "created": "17/Dec/09 11:30 AM",
     "id": "11176",
